               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "has part is a transitive, reflexive and antisymmetric relation between a whole and itself or a whole and its part."@en;
               sio:example "a collection of cars has as a car as a part;a car has an engine as a part; a car has a piston as a part;"@en;
