sio:SIO_000104 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/identifier> "SIO_000104";
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Language is a language entity which is the result of encoding and decoding information through systematic creation and usage of systems of symbols, each pairing a specific sign with an intended meaning, established through social conventions"@en;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
