               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "has disputing evidence is a relation between a proposition and something that disputes (does not directly support) the truth of the assertion."@en;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://semanticscience.org/ontology/sio.owl>;
               rdfs:label "is disputed by"@en;
