               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "is positionally after is a relation between entities placed on a dimensional axis in which the projection of the position of the first entity is numerically greater than the projection of the position of the second entity."@en;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty>,
                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
