               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Implication is a logical operator that holds between a set T of propositions and a proposition B, when every model (or interpretation or valuation) of T is also a model of B."@en;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://semanticscience.org/ontology/sio.owl>;
               rdfs:label "implies (->)"@en;
               rdfs:subClassOf sio:SIO_000238.
