               <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> sio:SIO_000369.
sio:SIO_000314 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/identifier> "SIO_000314";
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A polymer is a molecule composed of a connected set of monomeric residues."@en;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
