               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A partial differential equation (PDE) is a differential equation in which the unknown function is a function of multiple independent variables and the equation involves its partial derivatives."@en;
               a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
               rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://semanticscience.org/ontology/sio.owl>;
               rdfs:label "partial differential equation"@en;
