sio:SIO_010434 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/identifier> "SIO_010434";
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A molecular activator is a molecular regulator that realizes its disposition to conformationally change a target molecule and increase its functionality."@en;
